{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟計劃於2027年1月為 macOS 版 Microsoft Edge 推出擴展穩定版（Extended Stable）渠道，讓使用蘋果電腦的企業客户也能夠採用更緩慢、更加可預測的瀏覽器更新節奏。這項變化主要面向需要統一管理大量設備、對軟件兼容性和更新流程有嚴格要求的組織。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583680.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:42:57.027304+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:33:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:38:26.868645+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:38:26.868645+00:00","content_hash":"c0977e798644b5dc14deb5b274caadddce881ca325c018ebf95e04cdcaf3366b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}